freq.txt: the 50,000 most frequent lowercase words of SymSpell's
frequency_dictionary_en_82_765.txt (https://github.com/wolfgarbe/SymSpell),
one per line, most frequent first. Vobi uses the order only, to rank
spelling suggestions.

SymSpell built that list by intersecting Google Books Ngram data
(https://storage.googleapis.com/books/ngrams/books/datasetsv2.html,
licensed CC BY 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/) with
SCOWL (http://wordlist.aspell.net/, see LICENSE in this folder).

